te the sentence.</span><span class=\"bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob06re6aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": 2, "type": "template_override"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le06ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le06ob06re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le06ob06re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn8le06ob06re2img01.jpg", "text": "<p>Dear Readers,</p>\n<p>In response to your questions, I've compiled a list of tips for job hunting. </p>\n<ol start=\"1\"><li>Update and customize your r\u00e9sum\u00e9</li></ol>\nYour descriptions should be written in a concise and detailed way. Focus on the most recent and most significant information. Any personal pronouns are supposed to be removed and the length should be be kept to two pages. You ought to customize your resume for each potential position you apply for.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn8le06ob06re2img05.jpg", "text": "<ol start=\"2\"><li>Network</li></ol>\nCareer specialists will tell you that networking is the best way to land a new job. You ought to contact professionals in your field and let them know you're on the hunt. You should also ask them to serve as references. Job fairs and alumni groups are considered to be great networking routes.", "id": 2, "time": "26000"}, {"image": "engenn8le06ob06re2img02.jpg", "text": "<ol start=\"3\"><li>Google yourself and get creative</li></ol>\n<p>You had better do a basic internet search about yourself and see what pops up. You should also set any of your social networking profiles to \u201cprivate\u201d. That means they are made unavailable for viewing by any potential employers. You should consider using an alias on Twitter as that shall make it hard for people to search for you.</p>\n<p>I hope these tips will help land you that dream job! Happy hunting!</p>", "id": 3, "time": "44200"}]}}], "id": 1}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Tales from the Workplace", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Job Hunting", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's backgrounds in a wider variety of communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Simple Present Passive", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to focus on the <span class=\"underline\">doer</span>  of an action, you use the <span class=\"underline\">active structure</span>  of a sentence. <br/>When you want to put the focus on the <span class=\"underline\">receiver</span> of an action, you use a <span class=\"underline\">passive</span>  structure. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Active sentence = <span class=\"italic\">You</span> (subject) <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">should write</span> your descriptions</span> (object)<span class=\"italic\"> in a concise way.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Passive sentence = <span class=\"italic\">Your descriptions</span> (subject) <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">should be written</span> in a concise way</span> (by you). <br/>It is not necessary to mention the object in a passive sentence. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You make the passive form of a verb by using tenses of the <span class=\"italic\">be</span> verb followed by the past participle.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The Simple Present passive form is: <br/> Subject + <span class=\"italic\">is</span>/<span class=\"italic\">are</span> + past participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Job fairs <span class=\"strong\">are considered</span> to be great networking routes.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your descriptions should be written in a concise and detailed way.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Any personal pronouns are supposed to be removed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "That means they are made unavailable for viewing by any potential employers.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future Using <span class=\"italic\">Will</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Shall</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> and <span class=\"italic\">shall</span> to give information about the future or to make predictions (talk about what we think or guess) about the future. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Career specialists will tell you that networking is the best way to land a new job. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You should consider using an alias on Twitter as that shall make it hard for people to search for you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I hope these tips will help land you that dream job!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject + will + verb <br /><br> Will + subject + verb ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Career specialists <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will tell</span> you that networking is the best way to land a new job. </span><br /><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will you consider </span> reviewing the final report? </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Shall</span>  <br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Shall</span> is quite formal and generally avoided in conversation. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject + shall + verb<br /> <br> Shall + subject + verb ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You should consider using an alias on Twitter as that <span class=\\\"strong\\\">shall make</span> it hard for people to search for you.</span><br /><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Shall I call </span>again next week? </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Shall we dance?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Will you be having a birthday party this year?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to compile", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to create a list by taking information from different resources", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In response to your questions, I've compiled a list of tips for job hunting.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs and work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to customize", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make or \u200bchange something \u200baccording to the buyer's or user's \u200bneeds", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should update and customize your r\u00e9sum\u00e9 for each job application.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "potential", "type": "name"}, {"content": "possible", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need a different r\u00e9sum\u00e9 for each potential position you apply for.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to land", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to get or achieve something good", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Career specialists will tell you that networking is the best way to land a new job.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "field", "type": "name"}, {"content": "area of study or work", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You ought to contact professionals in your field.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "alumni", "type": "name"}, {"content": "men and women who have \u200bcompleted \u200btheir \u200bstudies at a \u200bcollege or \u200buniversity", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Job fairs and alumni groups are considered to be great networking routes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to serve", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to \u200bhelp \u200bachieve something or to be \u200buseful as something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should ask colleagues to serve as references.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "reference", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who \u200bknows you, to \u200bdescribe you and say if you are \u200bsuitable for a \u200bjob", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A potential employer will ask for your references.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob06aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "alias", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a \u200bfalse \u200bname", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You should consider using an alias on Twitter as that shall make it hard for people to search for you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le06ob06aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Look at an employment site on the Internet.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose a job that sounds interesting to you.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a customized r\u00e9sum\u00e9 for that job. If you don't have any work experience, invent a r\u00e9sum\u00e9.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include experience that you think is relevant to the job you are applying for.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Exchange r\u00e9sum\u00e9s with a partner and give your partner some suggestions on how to make his/her r\u00e9sum\u00e9 even better.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about jobs, work, manners and customs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about future action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what I should, ought to, had better, or am supposed to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a customized r\u00e9sum\u00e9.", "type": "text"}]}]}